  <NAME>Neuroinflammatory astrocyte subtypes in the mouse brain [bulk RNA-seq, Interferon_in_vitro]</NAME>
  <TITLE>Neuroinflammatory astrocyte subtypes in the mouse brain [bulk RNA-seq, Interferon_in_vitro]</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>RNA-seq of primary astrocytes exposed to different cytokines Overall design: Primary immunopanned astrocytes were treated with IFNg (3 ng/ml), IFNb (1000 U/ml), TNFa (30 ng/ml)+IL1a (3 ng/ml) +C1q (40 ng/ml) or combinations thereof for 24h, RNA collected and sequenced on a NovaSeq6000</DESCRIPTION>
